SDUSD::initialize
├── when called directly on the implementation
│   └── it should revert with InvalidInitialization because implementation initializers are disabled
├── when called on an already initialized proxy
│   └── it should revert with InvalidInitialization
├── when admin is zero address
│   └── it should revert with SDUSDZeroAddress
├── when pauser is zero address
│   └── it should revert with SDUSDZeroAddress
├── when DUSD is zero address
│   └── it should revert with SDUSDZeroAddress
├── when rewarder is zero address
│   └── it should revert with SDUSDZeroAddress
├── when seed shares is zero
│   └── it should revert with SDUSDZeroAmount
├── when reward duration is less than MIN_REWARD_DURATION
│   └── it should revert with SDUSDInvalidRewardDuration
├── when reward duration is greater than MAX_REWARD_DURATION
│   └── it should revert with SDUSDInvalidRewardDuration
└── when all initialization parameters are valid
    ├── it should set admin as owner
    ├── it should leave pending owner unset
    ├── it should set DUSD as the ERC-4626 asset
    ├── it should set the name to Staked DUSD
    ├── it should set the symbol to sDUSD
    ├── it should use the DUSD decimals
    ├── it should set the configured seed shares
    ├── it should set the configured deposit cap
    ├── it should emit DepositCapUpdated from zero
    ├── it should set the configured rewarder
    ├── it should emit RewarderUpdated from zero address
    ├── it should set the configured reward duration
    ├── it should emit RewardDurationUpdated from zero
    ├── it should authorize the configured pauser for PAUSE_TYPE
    ├── it should emit PauserUpdated for pauser
    ├── it should authorize admin as a pauser for PAUSE_TYPE
    ├── it should emit PauserUpdated for admin
    ├── it should leave PAUSE_TYPE unpaused
    ├── it should initialize accounted assets to zero
    ├── it should initialize deposit cap usage to zero
    ├── it should initialize reward state to zero
    ├── it should initialize total supply to zero
    ├── it should initialize total assets to zero
    ├── it should initialize the exchange rate at one DUSD per sDUSD
    ├── when reward duration equals MIN_REWARD_DURATION
    │   └── it should deploy successfully
    ├── when reward duration equals MAX_REWARD_DURATION
    │   └── it should deploy successfully
    └── when deposit cap is zero
        └── it should deploy successfully

SDUSD::deployment seed setup
└── when the deployer completes the required post-initialization seed deposit
    ├── it should mint the configured seed shares to address(1) and fund them with matching DUSD
    └── it should exclude the seed deposit from deposit cap usage
